{"id":"a30585c644c0e15f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter6 Uniform Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter — ZFC Filter6 Uniform Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter — ZFC Filter6 Uniform Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter-set]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter6-uniform-filter — ZFC Filter6 Uniform Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6UniformFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6UniformFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6UniformFilter}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6UniformFilter}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\kappa)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Uniformity supplements, rather than replaces, the filter axioms; the former file used the unrelated order-filter dependency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (set-filter predicate, see [[58-df-filter-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-equinumerous]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\